+
+`[governed_records] backend = "postgres"` stores the integrated Security/GRC,
+CRA, Agent Trust Auditor, Model Risk & AI Assurance Officer,
+continuous-evidence, and evidence-campaign records in the Postgres DSN already
+configured by `MAVERICK_PG_DSN` or
+`[world_model] dsn`. `auto` preserves the tenant-floored local JSON backend for
+a standard single-replica deployment and follows a configured Postgres world
+backend. `local` is an explicit compatibility choice.
