+The model-risk officer and its promotion interlock are independent switches.
+`enable = true` makes the governed inventory, declarations, evaluations,
+findings, incidents, decisions, deployment lineage, and assurance packs
+available. `gate_promotions = true` additionally makes the self-improvement
+promotion check fail closed. The gate re-reads exact CAS-bound artifact,
+declaration, evaluator, evaluation/red-team evidence, graph, and human-decision
+authority, then recomputes blocking findings. A different candidate payload,
+stale revision, expired or revoked review, missing authority, or
+malformed/unreadable enabled policy denies. Leave the gate false only when
+retaining compatibility behavior is an explicit deployment decision; reporting
+alone does not authorize a promotion.
