+The same selector governs the explicit identity-authorization records. Suite
+grant assignments, dashboard global role assignments, invitation state, and
+session-revocation epochs use
+reserved deployment-global rows that cannot inherit a request's ambient
+tenant; dashboard tenant roles bind the explicit tenant argument to a separate
+tenant-scoped row. Invitation redemption and its promised global role grant
