+Tenant lifecycle and explicit spend accounting use the same selector. In
+Postgres mode, each portable/case-folded tenant namespace has one
+deployment-global SHA-256-addressed claim, while lifecycle, explicit daily cap,
+usage, in-flight reservations, and settlement receipts share one tenant-scoped
