+## Strict authority mode
+
+When `[authority] mode = "strict"` (also forced by enterprise mode), stdio no
+longer runs under an anonymous ambient local identity. Configure the client as
+one active inbound Agent Trust principal:
+
+```toml
+[authority]
+mode = "strict"
+
+[mcp]
+stdio_principal = "desktop-copilot"
+
