+`MAVERICK_MCP_STDIO_PRINCIPAL` can supply the same registry id. Missing,
+synthetic, inactive, or unregistered identities stop the server before it reads
+the client pipe. Identity and capability are carried through resource,
+subscription, prompt, and task methods as well as tool calls.
